          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആദായവിൽപ്പന (ādāyavilppana) is a Malayalam compound built from ആദായം, profit, from Sanskrit ādāya, \"taking\" (Monier-Williams), and the native word വിൽപ്പന, a sale (DEDR 5421)."
